Re : Notice for Amendments of IMDG Regulation for Class 9/UN 2211, POLYMERIC BEADS, EXPANDABLE

Dear.
Pls refer to attached for subj issue.

Main contents is change of transport unit(Container) for UN 2211 (POLYMERIC BEADS, EXPANDABLE)
from Dry container to Open top container or One door off dry container.

Effective date is 01st Jan., 2014 basic on container discharging at last port.
It means that you have to check ETA at the time of discharging(delivery) port whether it is possible
to discharg(delivery) to cnee before 2013. 12. 24 in the light of cargo's delay.
Remind tt no more allow to stuff subj DG cargo in dry container.
Pls notice the information to your sales office and customers to follow IMDG code.
Thanks for your co-operation.
B.Rgds / SH Chang



